WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:06.000
[Industrial music builds]
The Citadel. 840 metres above the city.

00:06.000 --> 00:12.000
One operative. No way back.
Break through. Keep moving.

00:12.000 --> 00:16.500
[Heavy mechanical impact]
MANTICORE siege engine online.

00:16.500 --> 00:20.000
ASH VECTOR. Operation Black Rain.
Deploy. Break the line.
